  "description": "Two versions compared position by position. A position whose node the new version keeps, with a wait that keeps its meaning, is compatible. One whose node is gone, where another node of the new version would keep the wait, needs a mapping, and the candidates are named. One that no node of the new version can keep is impossible. A plan that maps the first and restarts the second makes every position compatible. A run at a compatible position can be moved, whatever the other positions are.",
